codex
The first test run found two assertions that still expect the old fixtures: DB-4 expects the NULL `ended_at` only in A, and the recovery test requires every artifact body to be nonempty. R-3’s empty archive can produce an empty listing locally, so I’ll update those assertions and add checks for the new evidence.
apply patch
